:0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0121,"r5":0.0607,"r1_spy":0.0159,"r5_spy":0.0678}}],"quotes":[{"c":"AXS 2018 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"The bottom line is that the fourth quarter exhibited an acceleration of the positive pricing trends we observed during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2018 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"This newfound discipline is having a tangible impact on risk appetite and pricing and are several anecdotes of price increases in the plus 100% to 300% range in the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2018 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Vogt","x":"These increases to a partially offset by premium adjustments in the property division as well as the restructuring of a significant treaty in our pro lines division.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q1","e":"axs","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Elyse Greenspan","x":"…some of your initial views as we think about the upcoming Florida renewals, just expectations for price increases, chatter (ph) any change in terms and conditions, and kind of can you peg the weight increases we might see there relative to how the loss-impacted accounts moved at both January 1…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q1-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q2","e":"axs","d":"2019-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"But price increases alone understate the true pace of progress in profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q2-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q3","e":"axs","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"Small E&O and Cyber were flat to down 1% or so although recent Cyber losses appear to be stabilizing that market providing opportunity for price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q3","e":"axs","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"And then to be fair, we're getting 17% price increases, and you can rest very assured, we are not taking anywhere close to that as reductions in loss ratios, we will incorporate in our reserving an assumption of a very, very heavy loss trend -- we'll show improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"But again, I think from a reserving perspective, I don't think that we would be reflecting the net price increase versus the loss trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Josh Shanker","x":"But when I listened to the price increase you spoke about, there were plenty of double-digit rate increases and certainly high single-digit rate increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"And we continue to look for additional opportunities for cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2019 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Albert A. Benchimol","x":"Notwithstanding these strong increases, we actually shrank the book over the year as we looked to rightsize our property exposures and manage our volatility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/axis-capital-holdings-ltd-axs-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"AXS 2020 Q3","e":"axs","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"Lower levels of favorable development, social inflation, the pandemic, more frequent natural catastrophes and lower interest rates drive the need for substantial price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2020 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2021-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"So across both our insurance and reinsurance segments, we saw positive pricing momentum to continue during the fourth quarter and into the January 1 renewals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2021 Q2","e":"axs","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"And while we're seeing pricing increases coming down from their peaks in many lines, others are moving up the net of which is we still anticipate that positive market conditions will continue, with average price increases in line with or above loss costs into 2022 and likely beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2021 Q2","e":"axs","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"The recent price increases bring industry profitability to a barely acceptable level of rate adequacy after many years of severe price competition and loss cost inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2021 Q3","e":"axs","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"Taking a broader view of both insurance and reinsurance markets, notwithstanding four years of price increases, not all lines offer adequate pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2021 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2022-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"We're getting strong price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/27/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2021 Q4","e":"axs","d":"2022-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"There's no question that those price increases are having a beneficial impact. on the overall book.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/27/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2022 Q1","e":"axs","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"The combination of strong price increases in prior periods, less new business opportunities, and the coming online of new capacity all led to a more competitive market, especially in the excess layers of public D&O towers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2022 Q2","e":"axs","d":"2022-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Benchimol","x":"As I shared last quarter, the combination of strong price increases in past periods, fewer new business opportunities, the coming online of new capacity, along with the recent decrease in the number of filed cases, all led to a more competitive environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/axis-capital-holdings-axs-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AXS 2026 Q1","e":"axs","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Kirk","x":"You're absolutely right, expenses year-over-year is relatively flat, and that does call in and shows the benefit of all the investments we've made in technology, including AI and where we're able to write a lot more high-quality business on the same expense base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/axis-capital-axs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AXS 2026 Q1","e":"axs","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Vincent Tizzio","x":"Our AI investments are contributing to expense ratio efficiency by redesigning and streamlining end-to-end workflows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/axis-capital-axs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AXS 2026 Q1","e":"axs","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Kirk","x":"I would note at this juncture, we incurred a below-the-line charge of $23 million for expense and restructuring actions taken during the quarter, largely in reinsurance as well as for the planned departure of 2 members of our senior leadership.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/axis-capital-axs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,9364,0,0,0,7773,1190],[37,1,10072,0,0,0,7755,1736],[38,1,8963,0,0,0,7294,1226],[39,1,10539,0,0,0,8779,1356],[40,1,8550,0,0,0,7137,1078],[41,1,10168,0,0,0,8803,906],[42,1,8802,0,0,0,7353,1049],[43,1,9416,0,0,0,7995,1110],[44,1,7744,0,0,0,6323,1120],[45,1,6636,0,0,0,5455,914],[46,1,6597,0,0,0,5307,992],[47,1,5699,0,0,0,4636,780],[48,1,6815,0,0,0,5668,818],[49,1,6939,0,0,0,5727,912],[50,1,7428,0,0,0,6495,663],[65,1,8535,0,0,0,2717,5544],[67,1,5919,0,0,0,1341,4124]],"cinema":[[36,1,9364,0,0,0,7773,1190],[37,1,10072,0,0,0,7755,1736],[38,1,8963,0,0,